nced Peptide Serums (5 mL each)<br\/><br\/>• 3 × Sterile Micro-Infusion Heads<\/p><p>Each serum and Micro-Infusion Head is designed for a single treatment. For best results, use one treatment every 10 days.<\/p>","step_1_enabled":true,"step_1_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Collagen_Peptide_How_To_Step2.png","step_1_title":"Prepare your skin","step_1_text":"<p>While the serum is saturating the Micro-Infusion Head, thoroughly cleanse your face to remove any makeup, sunscreen and skincare products.<\/p><p>Gently pat your skin dry. Your skin should be clean and completely dry before beginning your treatment.<\/p>","step_2_enabled":true,"step_2_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Advanced_Peptide_Infusion_System_Step-by-step-guide_step2.png","step_2_title":"Begin your treatment","step_2_text":"<p>Starting in the centre of your face, gently stamp the device onto your skin, working outwards towards your hairline.<\/p><p>Use a light, vertical stamping motion with approximately 50% overlap between each stamp to ensure even coverage. Avoid dragging or sliding the device across your skin.<\/p><p>Focus on areas where you'd like to improve the appearance of fine lines, wrinkles and uneven skin texture, including your forehead, cheeks, smile lines, jawline and neck if desired.<\/p><p>Continue until the serum has been evenly applied.<\/p>","step_3_enabled":true,"step_3_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Advanced_Peptide_Infusion_System_Step-by-step-guide_2_1.png","step_3_title":"Let it absorb","step_3_text":"<p>Once you've completed your treatment, gently pat any remaining serum into your skin using clean fingertips.<\/p><p>It's completely normal to experience mild redness or a slight tingling sensation immediately after treatment. This is a natural response to the micro-infusion process and typically subsides within a few hours.<\/p><p>Leave the serum on overnight for best results.<\/p>","step_4_enabled":true,"step_4_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Collagen_Peptide_How_To_Step4.png","step_4_title":"Aftercare","step_4_text":"<p>Avoid applying makeup, exfoliating acids, retinol or other active skincare products until the following day. We also recommend avoiding excessive sun exposure, saunas and swimming for 24 hours after treatment.<\/p><p>Repeat your treatment once every 10 days for the best results. With consistent use, you'll notice your skin becoming smoother, firmer and more radiant over time.<\/p>","step_5_enabled":false,"step_5_title":"","step_5_text":"","step_6_enabled":false,"step_6_title":"","step_6_text":"","step_7_enabled":false,"step_7_title":"","step_7_text":""},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["ai_gen_block_46b4bef_yQmH3c"],"settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"flex-start","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","gap":12,"section_width":"page-width","section_height":"","section_height_custom":50,"color_scheme":"","color_scheme_source":"false","background_media":"none","video_position":"cover","background_image_position":"cover","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"toggle_overlay":false,"overlay_color":"#00000026","overlay_style":"solid","gradient_direction":"to top","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0}}},"order":["hero_LtfCBJ","main","17804740066e652190","17851403350381f37b"]}